facts.PACKET-AMBIGUITY:
An ambiguity that changes public
      grammar, architecture, security or scope stops with an exact blocker;
      workers do not silently design.

facts.TERMINAL-STALL:
Initial or final-turn silence is a
      stall only after a bounded observation window and exact-process evidence;
      stop only that process.

harness-adapters.fence:
$settingsRoot = if ($env:VIBE_SETTINGS) {
  $env:VIBE_SETTINGS
} else {
  Join-Path $env:USERPROFILE '.vibe'
}
$launcher = Join-Path $settingsRoot 'opt/bin/claudez.ps1'
$pointer = 'Read PACKET.md in this cwd first and follow it exactly.'
Push-Location -LiteralPath $workerCwd
try {
  & $launcher -p $pointer --permission-mode bypassPermissions
  $workerExit = $LASTEXITCODE
}
finally { Pop-Location }
